  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Disaster Management and Climate Resilience in Solomon Islands &#x2013; 2020 to 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment provided support to the Solomon Islands Ministry of Environment, Climate Change, Disaster Management and Meteorological services. It provided further support during COVID-19 by strengthening the capacity of the national and provincial disaster management to respond COVID-19 through logistics and delivery of supplies to remote areas. This investment also provided small-scale infrastructure for disaster resilience and improvement of local capacity for 24/7 weather observation. Community resilience and assessments were also provided through this support from 2020-23.</narrative>
  </description>
